            <ArticleTitle>Extracranial metastatic meningioma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>513-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Meningiomas rarely metastasize outside the intracranial compartment. We report a case of disseminated metastases from a recurrent intracranial meningioma and review the imaging and pathological literature on metastatic meningioma.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
